WEBVTT

00:02:59.467 --> 00:03:02.053
affect mood, and impair memory.

00:03:02.511 --> 00:03:05.264
And it can irritate 
the gastrointestinal tract

00:03:05.264 --> 00:03:08.226
and inflame the lining 
of the stomach and intestines.

00:03:08.559 --> 00:03:11.354
Alcohol may also slow down
stomach emptying,

00:03:11.354 --> 00:03:14.523
which could lead to increased
production of gastric acid.

00:03:15.191 --> 00:03:18.819
This is why alcohol can cause 
stomach pain, nausea, and vomiting.

00:03:19.654 --> 00:03:23.074
Alcoholic drinks also contain other
substances that are produced

00:03:23.074 --> 00:03:27.328
during the fermentation process 
that give the drink its specific flavor.

